{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/217031-keeping-track-of-pacts","id":217031,"title":"Keeping track of Pacts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-02T16:31:40-07:00","id":217031,"title":"Keeping track of Pacts","content":"I wanted to know does anyone have any to help keep track of pacts and deals ? <br /> <br /> Cuirrently for patch jobs I just using a word doc set up like and I fill it up with bits of information till I have a complete identity. <br /> <br /> Name:<br /> Age:<br /> Appearance:<br /> Bio:<br /> Cover Rating:<br /> Merits:<br /> <br /> Also question what constitutes a single dot in a cover rating ?<br /> <br /> Example I made a deal to take some ones criminal record for one dot of resources. Is that criminal history considered 1 dot ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T17:02:28-07:00","id":217062,"title":"","content":"Depends... is it the whole rapsheet? how extensive is it? If he's only got some unpaid traffic tickets then it's just Lesser (just one XP instead of a whole dot of cover). If he or she is a career criminal, it's probably Greater.<br /> <br /> Think on the Cover rating on terms of how much reality backs your Unchained's stolen identity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T22:58:27-07:00","id":217195,"title":"","content":"Cover is connectedness. The creepy shut in down the street who no one ever sees has a low connection to the world, so he'd be a 1 dot cover. However, if the shut in had this magnificent life on the internet, with dozens of friends, and an active posting routine on 12 different special interest forums, he'd be closer to 10. It is harder to pull threads at the reality of an identity if the identity is active and known.<br /> <br /> As for keeping track of things, I make my players write out the exact contract they want to use, and then exploit the loopholes they missed. At this point my most active pact makers carry folders with 3-4 contracts ready to use or trade. They've even started charging other players in game to make contracts for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2861-nyx","name":"Nyx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2861_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-03T13:52:54-07:00","id":217574,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyx</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/217031-keeping-track-of-pacts?p=217195#post217195\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for keeping track of things, I make my players write out the exact contract they want to use, and then exploit the loopholes they missed. At this point my most active pact makers carry folders with 3-4 contracts ready to use or trade. They've even started charging other players in game to make contracts for them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Talk about needlessly complicated... What happened with the classic &quot;IOU 1 Soul&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-03T23:29:29-07:00","id":217913,"title":"","content":"That went out the window in a much earlier game, due to player abuse. Long story short, I'm not really allowed to play deal/pact/contract makers anymore.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2861-nyx","name":"Nyx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2861_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}